        <body>
            <div xml:id="d38">

                <pb facs="0198" n="80" sameAs="frus:frus1928v02/pg80"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.4215 Air Pollution/49</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Canada</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Phillips</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ottawa</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-02-27"><hi rendition="#italic">February 27,
                        1928</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received March 1.]</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 259</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Referring to the Department’s instruction
                    No. 160, of February 18, concerning the question of the extent of the damages to
                    trees and crops of property owners in the State of Washington from the drift of
                    fumes from the Consolidated Smelting and Mining Company of Canada, I have the
                    honor to transmit herewith enclosed an original duplicate, with enclosures, of a
                    note received from the Department of External Affairs today on this subject.</p>
                <pb facs="0199" n="81" xml:id="pg81"/>
                <p>In view of the observations of the Secretary of State for External Affairs on
                    page 2, I should be pleased to be instructed as to what further action, if any,
                    the Department desires the Legation to take in the matter.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>For the Minister:<lb/><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">H. Dorsey
                            Newson</hi></signed><lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Second Secretary of
                        Legation</hi></closer>


                <xi:include href="d38-a1.xml" xpointer="d38-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
